/*
  CollapsibleCommandGroup.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 feature view · 0224 · CollapsibleCommandGroup (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `CollapsibleCommandGroup` resolves (table "CollapsibleCommandGroup") lives here
  with its web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the category labels the web `CollapsibleCommandGroup` renders
  through `CATEGORY_META[category].labelKey` (web source
  features/system/commands.ts). The second group backs the native chrome the web
  carries implicitly (the count read-out, the disclosure accessibility state/hint,
  and the never-blank empty state), so the Swift sources hold no English literals.
*/

